# Easy Steps (`#how`) — TS_fix implementation

Source of truth: `local_docs/NEW_GREEN_DESIGN/fix/TS_fix.txt`

Do **not** modify this file unless the user explicitly asks for Easy Steps / `#how` changes.

## Section title

- `app-header-h3` + `text-title` (`--title-color`), centered
- Content: `easyStepsContent.title` from `landing.ts`

## Grid (critical)

One **vertical** container (`flex flex-col w-full`) holds **three separate full-width rows** — not one `flex-row` with three cards side by side.

Each row:
- `flex flex-row w-full`
- Row 1: `justify-start` — card aligned left
- Row 2: `justify-center` — card centered
- Row 3: `justify-end` — card aligned right
- Contains exactly **one** `EasyStepCard`

Same grid on all breakpoints; only card width changes responsively.

## Card width (all steps)

```
w-[83%] min-[600px]:w-[577px] bp840:w-[600px]
```

## Card content

- Transparent background; decorative PNG in top-right (`landing/easy-steps/1.png`, `2.png`, `3.png`)
- **No** watermark digit numbers
- Inner text always `text-left`
- Title: `app-header-h4` + `text-action` (`--action-default-color`)
- Body: `app-header-subheadline-regular` + `text-average`

## Step 2 image special case

- **≥600px:** `2.png` protrudes 50% above the card (`-translate-y-1/2`); row has `overflow-visible`, `pt-16`, and `mt-12`/`mt-16` gap from the row above
- **≤599px:** image fully inside top-right corner of the card (`translate-y-0`, card `overflow-hidden`); **no** `mt` between row 1 and row 2 (`max-[599px]:mt-0`) since the image fits within the card padding

## Assets

Synced via `pnpm sync-design` from `local_docs/NEW_GREEN_DESIGN/fix/{1,2,3}.png` → `public/landing/easy-steps/`.

## Anti-patterns

- Single `flex-row` parent with three cards (wrong grid)
- Watermark digit overlays (`accent-theme-200` spans)
- Ad-hoc `font-serif` / `primary-theme-*` typography instead of global text styles
- Desktop/mobile dual DOM or auto-rotate (removed legacy behavior)
